'' android-x86_64: linux-x86_64's sections -- ELF, linked by lld, which sorts .init_array.NNNNN by
'' number; Bionic's linker runs DT_INIT_ARRAY in order. Measured on the emulator: a two-module
'' program's numbered and unnumbered constructors and destructors run in linux-x86_64's order
'' (docs/tiko-android FACTS). See structor-order-linux.test.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target android-x86_64 --emit-ir tests/codegen/src/structor-order.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: target triple = "x86_64-linux-android29"
'' EXPECT-OUT: internal global ptr @"P200", section ".init_array.00200", align 8
'' EXPECT-OUT: internal global ptr @"P101", section ".init_array.00101", align 8
'' EXPECT-OUT: internal global ptr @"Q101", section ".fini_array.00101", align 8
